Grammar

    0 $accept: any_program $end

    1 any_program: ε
    2            | program

    3 program: program_elem
    4        | program program_elem

    5 program_elem: var_declaration
    6             | function_definition

    7 function_definition_start: ID O_PAR func_params C_PAR O_CURLY_BRACKET

    8 function_definition: function_definition_start statement_list C_CURLY_BRACKET

    9 func_params: ε
   10            | some_params

   11 some_params: variable
   12            | some_params COMMA variable

   13 variable: LONG_ID
   14         | ID

   15 var_list: variable
   16         | var_list COMMA variable

   17 var_declaration: AUTO var_list

   18 expression: function_call
   19           | variable
   20           | NB
   21           | expression PLUS expression
   22           | expression MINUS expression
   23           | variable EQUAL expression
   24           | expression ASTE expression
   25           | expression PERCENT expression
   26           | expression SLASH expression

   27 expression_list: expression
   28                | expression_list COMMA expression

   29 function_call: ID O_PAR expression_list C_PAR
   30              | ID O_PAR C_PAR

   31 if_prelude: IF O_PAR expression C_PAR

   32 if_condition: if_prelude statement

   33 optional_else: ε
   34              | ELSE statement

   35 condition_branching: if_condition optional_else

   36 statement: condition_branching
   37          | O_CURLY_BRACKET statement_list C_CURLY_BRACKET
   38          | var_declaration SEMICOLON
   39          | expression SEMICOLON
   40          | RETURN expression SEMICOLON

   41 statement_list: ε
   42               | statement_list statement


